{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ionis</strong> has lost the primordial particles that sustain her existence. Help her recover them and continue her journey to uncover the long-buried secrets of her species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the universe drifts <strong>Ionis</strong>, a being of <strong>living plasma</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In her <strong>Primordial Form</strong>, she exists as a <strong>radiant sphere of violet energy</strong>, free to slip between stars and ride the currents of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ionis</strong> searches for others of her kind: ancient, plasma-born entities created in an age before galaxies fully formed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But her journey is driven by more than loneliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is chasing a mystery her people left behind, <strong>Why is the universe dark if there are countless stars?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015100?t=1768424228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015100/3b32860f8f09c7f4d80faaa0e8b34c1d8267ca1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768424228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015100/f343013d9f3ab8d0c451bae373442b6187a8511c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768424228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015100/f343013d9f3ab8d0c451bae373442b6187a8511c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768424228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ionis</strong> has 